248
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:30,240
Card of last will? Yes,

249
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:34,057
it allows me to draw five
new cards into my hand

250
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:37,400
when one of my monster's
attack points is decreased.

251
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:39,717
Now Merrick, it's a brand new hand.

252
00:15:39,800 --> 00:15:41,506
This could change everything.

253
00:15:42,140 --> 00:15:44,257
I offer you my gratitude.

254
00:15:44,340 --> 00:15:47,700
Gaining five new cards isn't
all you've allowed me to do.

255
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:52,060
By destroying Makiura, you've
activated its special ability.

256
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:56,000
Now I'll play a card that
will shortly annihilate you.

257
00:15:57,180 --> 00:16:04,037
this shadow game's quite amusing now
prepare to live out your worst nightmare

258
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:07,597
by way of the trap card nightmare wheel

259
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:13,240
not only does it trap your amazon fighter

260
00:16:14,780 --> 00:16:20,020
but the nightmare wheel will also take
500 life points from you every turn

261
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:21,410
Hmm.

262
00:16:21,493 --> 00:16:25,020
I was expecting something
I couldn't handle. Pardon?

263
00:16:25,300 --> 00:16:28,065
I thought you'd try
something like this, Marek.

264
00:16:28,180 --> 00:16:31,240
So I played this call, Rescue Operation.

265
00:16:31,580 --> 00:16:35,680
This trap card allows me to rescue
my Amazon fighter from your trap.

266
00:16:35,920 --> 00:16:39,096
It also lets me summon a new
monster to the field now.

267
00:16:39,520 --> 00:16:41,400
Do you know what this means?

268
00:16:41,680 --> 00:16:45,697
So, are you going to summon the
Egyptian god card you took from me?

269
00:16:45,780 --> 00:16:46,610
Of course not.

270
00:16:46,693 --> 00:16:49,037
I paid attention the
last time it was played.

271
00:16:49,120 --> 00:16:53,297
And I know if I summoned it now,
without sacrificing any monsters first,

272
00:16:53,380 --> 00:16:55,420
it would have zero attack points.

273
00:16:55,780 --> 00:16:56,840
But not to worry.

274
00:16:57,060 --> 00:17:01,160
I'll play that winged dragon by
the end of my next turn. She crazy?

275
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:03,377
How's she ever gonna pull that off, Yuki?

276
00:17:03,460 --> 00:17:05,100
But first things first.

277
00:17:05,580 --> 00:17:08,380
Amazon Fighter, return to my hand now!

278
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:19,520
And now to summon a new monster.

279
00:17:19,980 --> 00:17:21,620
Ah, this ought to do.

280
00:17:23,940 --> 00:17:26,220
I summon Cyber Harpy.

281
00:17:29,420 --> 00:17:30,479
Yeah, my favorite.

282
00:17:31,140 --> 00:17:32,820
Now I just need one card.

283
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:34,374
Let's hope this is it.

284
00:17:34,500 --> 00:17:38,637
If I draw the right card, I'll be able
to summon the Winged Dragon of Bra.

285
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,660
Come on.

286
00:17:40,600 --> 00:17:41,540
This'll help.

287
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:45,360
I play Graceful Charity. Now!

288
00:17:45,620 --> 00:17:49,240
A magic card that lets me draw
three new cards from my deck.

289
00:17:49,480 --> 00:17:51,920
And then I discard two from my hand.

290
00:17:52,860 --> 00:17:54,507
First I'll get rid of these.

291
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:58,080
And now let's see if I
drew the card I need.

292
00:17:58,780 --> 00:18:00,680
Oh, I am so good.

293
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:02,520
Well, you asked for it.

294
00:18:02,820 --> 00:18:05,360
And now, Merrick, I'm
gonna give it to you.

295
00:18:05,860 --> 00:18:06,919
Ready, sweetheart?

296
00:18:07,700 --> 00:18:08,759
The winged dragon.

297
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:11,860
But Mai only has one monster on the field.

298
00:18:12,100 --> 00:18:14,300
You won't be smiling for too long,

299
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:17,160
especially when you see this.

300
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:23,200
I play the magic card Elegant Egotist.

301
00:18:23,460 --> 00:18:28,040
And now Elegant Egotist shall
turn my one harpy lady into three.

302
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:38,400
Let's give a big battle city
hello to the Harpy Lady sisters.

303
00:18:39,140 --> 00:18:40,860
She got three monsters.

304
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,080
She did it.

305
00:18:42,280 --> 00:18:44,697
And now I'll sacrifice these three lovely

306
00:18:44,780 --> 00:18:47,360
ladies and summon the
winged dragon abroad.

307
00:18:58,040 --> 00:19:00,780
The winged dragon of Ra
is now in my control!

308
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,540
Such a fool!

309
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:19,016
Does she really think she
can control an Egyptian god?

310
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:21,720
I'm afraid it's quite the opposite!

311
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:23,720
It will control her!

312
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:31,820
What in the world is that thing?

313
00:19:32,120 --> 00:19:35,280
The winged dragon of Ra
is locked in that sphere.

314
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:36,740
No way.

315
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:38,780
This isn't good.

316
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:41,460
But how can I use it?

317
00:19:41,900 --> 00:19:44,020
You can't use it, you fool.

318
00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:46,960
You'll never unlock its ancient powers.
